  {
   "id": "3on3-freestyle-26405@major-2017-11-07",
   "gameId": "3on3-freestyle-26405",
   "displayName": "Today's update and upcoming Contents",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2017-11-07T09:14:23.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Ballers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here are the details of our recent maintenance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A.Web Ranking Page",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today, you can now check the rank record in 3on3 game as below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Web Ranking page provides a detailed match record of your 3vs3 / 1vs1 / Challenge mode.: -In particular, we provide a detailed record of the various game records in the game so that you can compare your level of skill with others.: Check out your rank here: http://3on3rank.fsgames.com/steam: B. New Events: Also, we have opened 2 events today, so I hope you all enjoy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Mission Impossible",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Obtain Pro Name tag and Joey’s Special outfit and free items by just completing the missions!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check this link: http://3on3.fsgames.com/en/news/event/steam/318",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Log in Everyday",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Don’t Miss a single day in our Log in Everyday event!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Link: http://3on3.fsgames.com/en/news/event/steam/317",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As we have announced, we will be updating the mouse control on this coming Thursday (November 9th).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Plus, soon we will be updating the 'Crew System' so you all can communicate with other ballers in FS City.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in the court!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-3on3 FreeStyle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
