  {
   "id": "3on3-freestyle-26405@post-2017-10-24",
   "gameId": "3on3-freestyle-26405",
   "displayName": "Patch note (Oct.24th): Key Changes / Halloween Event",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2017-10-24T08:54:58.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello, Ballers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rather than updating a new system, we have decided to concentrate more on listening to community’s feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will develop and improve the game based on what the community wants.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Working on a mouse control option is the first priority at this moment)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "But still, we have prepared tons of Halloween candies for you all!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Are ready to get some free candies?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Let me list up some changes we made first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Captcha system has been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "> To prevent Auto program users, we have added Captcha system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you encounter any suspicious, ill-mannered, or abusive behavior on the courts, please use the ‘Report System’ to report player.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "From today, we will suspend reported ballers EVERY 3 DAYS based on the number of reports the player has received. Let's clean up the court together!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Home key and End key have been changed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As we announced before, we have changed some keys that are not so convenient and assigned it to other keys.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Home key -> [ Tab ] key",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "End key -> [ ` ] key",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Customizing Keyboard control UI Change",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We have received some reports that key customizing is not working. (actually, it works fine)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We thought that there was not much of info how to save the customized key settings and that caused the misunderstanding of the system.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We concluded that the reason why users were unable to save their customized key settings is because there was no proper guide on how to save the customized key. (We would like to apologize for the confusion it has caused)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here is how we changed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Don't forget to press 'Space' key every time if you want to save the key settings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Brightness option",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "> This option should work properly now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Halloween Court & Halloween event",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Halloween is just around the corner!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To have frightfully spooky Halloween, we have prepared the Halloween court and event to spook you!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please park all brooms and trick every ballers with your Freestyle moves in FS City!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Link: http://3on3.fsgames.com/en/news/event/steam/281",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-3on3 Freestyle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
