  {
   "id": "3on3-freestyle-26405@post-2017-10-18",
   "gameId": "3on3-freestyle-26405",
   "displayName": "[Patch Note] Bug fix: chat / resolution / server",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2017-10-18T07:15:14.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings 3on3 Streetballers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all for playing 3on3 FreeStyle and reporting us a bug.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "If you were not able to download a patch and the game shows the error [version is not matched], please restart a Steam client.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Here is a list of bugs we have fixed, so please check below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Following bugs have been fixed",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A. The chat suddenly crashes and shows the HTML codes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "B. A Players cannot change the chatting channel (Local/ Team / Crew) by pressing a tab key.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "C. An opposing team’s group chat is visible to players during the match.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "D. A Player can’t chat with his team during a Time-out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "** If you can not see the teammate's team chatting, please check if you have downloaded the latest patch.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "2. Resolution",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you have a monitor that does not support 16:9 ratio, the game will automatically find the resolution corresponding to your monitor.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "3. Matching server (auto-select)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The game will properly select the matching server that has lower ping automatically.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "4. Macro Chat for keyboard",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Players who use a keyboard to play 3on3FS may able to use Macro Chat during the match from today by pressing following keys:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "> 1 / 2/ 3/ 4/ F1 / F2 / F3 / F4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "** you can't change the keys for Macro Chat",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are also checking on every issue you all have uploaded on the Steam community.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Let us know anytime what should be improved via Steam community board!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "(We are considering to add a mouse control option in the future!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "3on3 FreeStyle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
